            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't have maraschino liquor, so I improvised and subbed maraschino cherry juice and a little vodka. This was nice and tart w/the grapefruit juice. I'm a big fan of bubbles, so I topped it off w/a little Diet 7up. CHEERS, Allrecipes!",
